WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:04.337
You normalized two runs and
worked their dispositions.

3
00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:07.313
You recorded the review
of an investigate result.

4
00:00:07.313 --> 00:00:12.336
You opened a closure register, routed to
the pages that remediate each family,

5
00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:15.162
with a default weighting
the owner refines.

6
00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:17.749
And you checked exceptions
against their approvers.

7
00:00:17.749 --> 00:00:23.330
The evidence an I S S O keeps from this
module: the normalized results and summary,

8
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:28.150
the dispositions, the reviews and
exceptions files, and the register.

9
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.075
Keep the out folder from Lab 1.

10
00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:33.803
Module 4, reconcile, re-run
and keep the evidence,

11
00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:36.910
compares these two runs, and seals them.
